        </span>\n                    <i class=\"ph ph-check mt-1 text-[15px] text-[#777A82]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-6-4\" data-name=\"read checkmark icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"flex w-full gap-3 rounded-md px-2.5 py-3 text-left hover:bg-[#292A2F]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7\" data-name=\"read notification item 2\">\n                    <span class=\"w-2 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-1\" data-name=\"read spacer indicator slot\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#6C8D78] text-[11px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-2\" data-name=\"sender avatar initials\">\n                        TD\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-3\" data-name=\"notification content block\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-3-1\" data-name=\"sender context row\">\n                            <strong class=\"truncate font-semibold text-[#C2C4CA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-3-1-1\" data-name=\"sender name text\">\n                                Thanh Duy\n                            </strong>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#858890]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-3-1-2\" data-name=\"context connector text\">\n                                trong\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"truncate text-[#AEB0B6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-3-1-3\" data-name=\"group name text\">\n                                Nhóm Thiết kế\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#92959D]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-3-2\" data-name=\"notification type label\">\n                            Tin nhắn mới\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block text-[12px] leading-[1.45] text-[#92959D]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-3-3\" data-name=\"notification preview text\">\n                            Cảm ơn mọi người, mình đã nhận được.\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ph ph-check mt-1 text-[15px] text-[#777A82]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-7-4\" data-name=\"read checkmark icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n                <button class=\"flex w-full gap-3 rounded-md px-2.5 py-3 text-left hover:bg-[#292A2F]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8\" data-name=\"read notification item 3\">\n                    <span class=\"w-2 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-1\" data-name=\"read spacer indicator slot\">\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"flex h-9 w-9 shrink-0 items-center justify-center rounded-full bg-[#997F58] text-[11px] font-extrabold text-white\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-2\" data-name=\"sender avatar initials\">\n                        PL\n                    </span>\n                    <span class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-3\" data-name=\"notification content block\">\n                        <span class=\"flex items-center gap-1.5 text-[13px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-3-1\" data-name=\"sender context row\">\n                            <strong class=\"truncate font-semibold text-[#C2C4CA]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-3-1-1\" data-name=\"sender name text\">\n                                Phương Linh\n                            </strong>\n                            <span class=\"text-[#858890]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-3-1-2\" data-name=\"context connector text\">\n                                trong\n                            </span>\n                            <span class=\"truncate text-[#AEB0B6]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-3-1-3\" data-name=\"channel name text\">\n                                #hỏi-đáp\n                            </span>\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#92959D]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-3-2\" data-name=\"notification type label\">\n                            Trả lời tin nhắn\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"mt-1 block text-[12px] leading-[1.45] text-[#92959D]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-3-3\" data-name=\"notification preview text\">\n                            Đã rõ, mình sẽ gửi lại sau.\n                        </span>\n                    </span>\n                    <i class=\"ph ph-check mt-1 text-[15px] text-[#777A82]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-3-8-4\" data-name=\"read checkmark icon\">\n                    </i>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-2 border-t border-[#151619] px-4 py-3 text-[11px] leading-4 text-[#92959D]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-4\" data-name=\"inbox footer hint bar\">\n                <i class=\"ph ph-info text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-4-4-1\" data-name=\"info icon\">\n                </i>\n                Chọn thông báo để mở đúng tin nhắn trong hội thoại.\n            </div>\n        </aside>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
