                    <div class=\"mt-6 rounded-md bg-[#282a2f] px-3 py-2.5\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-8\" data-name=\"connection status alert card\">\n                        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2 text-[11px] font-semibold text-[#ffb4b4]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-8-1\" data-name=\"alert headline row\">\n                            <i class=\"ph ph-plugs-connected text-[15px]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-8-1-1\" data-name=\"plugs connected icon\">\n                            </i>\n                            <span data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-8-1-2\" data-name=\"alert headline text\">\n                                Kết nối gián đoạn\n                            </span>\n                        </div>\n                        <div class=\"mt-1 text-[10px] leading-4 text-[#858891]\" data-kid=\"1-1-3-2-2-8-2\" data-name=\"alert description text\">\n                            Tệp chưa được gửi. Bản nháp vẫn còn trong ô soạn.\n                        </div>\n                    </div>\n                </aside>\n            </section>\n        </main>\n    </div>\n</div>\n",
