ợp buổi học hôm qua ở đây. Mọi người tải về xem nhé.\n                            </p>\n                            <div class=\"mt-2 flex items-center gap-3 w-[390px] max-w-full px-3 py-2 rounded-lg bg-[#202125]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-2-3\" data-name=\"PDF file attachment card\">\n                                <div class=\"w-9 h-10 rounded-md bg-[#D94B4B] flex items-center justify-center text-white text-[19px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-2-3-1\" data-name=\"PDF file type badge\">\n                                    <i class=\"ph ph-file-pdf\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-2-3-1-1\" data-name=\"PDF file icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </div>\n                                <div class=\"min-w-0 flex-1\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-2-3-2\" data-name=\"attachment info container\">\n                                    <div class=\"text-[13px] font-semibold truncate text-[#F2F3F5]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-2-3-2-1\" data-name=\"attachment filename\">\n                                        Tổng_hợp_bài_giảng_tuần_04.pdf\n                                    </div>\n                                    <div class=\"text-[11px] text-[#96989F] mt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-2-3-2-2\" data-name=\"attachment file details\">\n                                        PDF · 2.4 MB\n                                    </div>\n                                </div>\n                                <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-md text-[#B7BAC1] hover:bg-[#3B3D44] hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[18px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-2-3-3\" data-name=\"download attachment button\" title=\"Tải xuống\">\n                                    <i class=\"ph ph-download-simple\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-4-2-3-3-1\" data-name=\"download icon\">\n                                    </i>\n                                </button>\n                            </div>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                    <article class=\"group flex gap-4 py-1.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-5\" data-name=\"reply message\">\n                        <img alt=\"Ảnh đại diện Đức Minh\" class=\"w-10 h-10 rounded-full object-cover shrink-0 mt-0.5\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-5-1\" data-name=\"sender avatar image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/128?u=duc-minh\"/>\n                        <div class=\"min-w-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-5-2\" data-name=\"message body container\">\n                            <div class=\"flex items-baseline gap-2\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-5-2-1\" data-name=\"message author and time row\">\n                                <span class=\"font-bold text-[#F2F3F5]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-5-2-1-1\" data-name=\"sender display name\">\n                                    Đức Minh\n                                </span>\n                                <span class=\"text-[11px] text-[#96989F]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-5-2-1-2\" data-name=\"message timestamp\">\n                                    Hôm nay lúc 10:45\n                                </span>\n                            </div>\n                            <p class=\"mt-0.5 text-[14px] leading-[21px] text-[#DCDDDE]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-1-5-2-2\" data-name=\"message text\">\n                                Đẹp đó Linh, mình sẽ thêm lịch ôn vào tối thứ năm.\n                            </p>\n                        </div>\n                    </article>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"h-[38px] shrink-0 flex items-center gap-3 pl-1 text-[#B7BAC1]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2\" data-name=\"typing indicator\">\n                    <div class=\"flex items-end gap-[3px] h-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-1\" data-name=\"typing animated dots\">\n                        <span class=\"w-[3px] h-2 rounded bg-[#B7BAC1]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-1-1\" data-name=\"typing dot one\">\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"w-[3px] h-3 rounded bg-[#B7BAC1]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-1-2\" data-name=\"typing dot two\">\n                        </span>\n                        <span class=\"w-[3px] h-1.5 rounded bg-[#B7BAC1]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-1-3\" data-name=\"typing dot three\">\n                        </span>\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"text-[12px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-2\" data-name=\"typing text\">\n                        <strong class=\"text-[#DCDDDE]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-1-2-2-1\" data-name=\"typing user name\">\n                            Mai Linh\n                        </strong>\n                        đang nhập…\n                    </span>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"px-6 pb-6 pt-1 shrink-0\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2\" data-name=\"message composer area\">\n                <div class=\"min-h-[52px] rounded-lg bg-[#313338] px-3 flex items-center gap-3\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1\" data-name=\"message composer toolbar\">\n                    <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full text-[#B7BAC1] hover:text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[22px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-1\" data-name=\"attach file button\" title=\"Đính kèm tệp\">\n                        <i class=\"ph ph-plus-circle\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-1-1\" data-name=\"plus circle icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <div class=\"w-px h-7 bg-[#42444A]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-2\" data-name=\"composer toolbar separator\">\n                    </div>\n                    <span class=\"flex-1 text-[#96989F] text-[14px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-3\" data-name=\"message input placeholder\">\n                        Nhắn tin trong #học-tập\n                    </span>\n                    <button class=\"text-[20px] text-[#B7BAC1] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-4\" data-name=\"sticker button\" title=\"Gửi sticker\">\n                        <i class=\"ph ph-sticker\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-4-1\" data-name=\"sticker icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"text-[20px] text-[#B7BAC1] hover:text-white\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-5\" data-name=\"emoji picker button\" title=\"Chọn emoji\">\n                        <i class=\"ph ph-smiley\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-5-1\" data-name=\"smiley icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                    <button class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-md bg-[#5865F2] text-white flex items-center justify-center text-[17px]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-6\" data-name=\"send message button\" title=\"Gửi tin nhắn\">\n                        <i class=\"ph ph-paper-plane-right\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-1-6-1\" data-name=\"send paper plane icon\">\n                        </i>\n                    </button>\n                </div>\n                <div class=\"mt-2 pl-1 text-[10px] text-[#8E9299]\" data-kid=\"1-3-2-2-2\" data-name=\"composer keyboard hint text\">\n                    Enter để gửi · Shift + Enter để xuống dòng\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </section>\n    </main>\n    <aside class=\"w-[220px] shrink-0 bg-[#1E1F23] px-3 pt-5 border-l border-[#202125]\" data-kid=\"1-4\" data-name=\"right members sidebar\">\n        <div class=\"text-[11px] font-extrabold tracking-wide text-[#96989F] px-2 mb-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-1\" data-name=\"members count header\">\n            THÀNH VIÊN — 4\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"text-[11px] font-bold text-[#96989F] px-2 mb-2\" data-kid=\"1-4-2\" data-name=\"group members section title\">\n            THÀNH VIÊN TRONG NHÓM\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 px-2 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-[#2B2D32]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3\" data-name=\"member row\">\n            <img alt=\"Ảnh đại diện Thảo Nguyễn\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-1\" data-name=\"member avatar image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/96?u=thao-nguyen\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-[#DCDDDE]\" data-kid=\"1-4-3-2\" data-name=\"member name label\">\n                Thảo Nguyễn\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 px-2 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-[#2B2D32]\" data-kid=\"1-4-4\" data-name=\"member row\">\n            <img alt=\"Ảnh đại diện Mai Linh\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-1\" data-name=\"member avatar image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/96?u=mai-linh\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-[#DCDDDE]\" data-kid=\"1-4-4-2\" data-name=\"member name label\">\n                Mai Linh\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 px-2 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-[#2B2D32]\" data-kid=\"1-4-5\" data-name=\"member row\">\n            <img alt=\"Ảnh đại diện Bảo Long\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-4-5-1\" data-name=\"member avatar image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/96?u=bao-long\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-[#DCDDDE]\" data-kid=\"1-4-5-2\" data-name=\"member name label\">\n                Bảo Long\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"flex items-center gap-2.5 px-2 py-2 rounded-md hover:bg-[#2B2D32]\" data-kid=\"1-4-6\" data-name=\"member row\">\n            <img alt=\"Ảnh đại diện Đức Minh\" class=\"w-8 h-8 rounded-full object-cover\" data-kid=\"1-4-6-1\" data-name=\"member avatar image\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://i.pravatar.cc/96?u=duc-minh\"/>\n            <span class=\"text-[#DCDDDE]\" data-kid=\"1-4-6-2\" data-name=\"member name label\">\n                Đức Minh\n            </span>\n        </div>\n        <div class=\"mt-7 mx-2 border-t border-[#34363C] pt-4\" data-kid=\"1-4-7\" data-name=\"channel info panel\">\n            <div class=\"text-[11px] font-bold tracking-wide text-[#96989F] mb-3\" data-kid=\"1-4-7-1\" data-name=\"channel info title\">\n                THÔNG TIN KÊNH\n            </div>\n            <div class=\"flex gap-2 text-[12px] text-[#B7BAC1]\" data-kid=\"1-4-7-2\" data-name=\"channel name row\">\n                <i class=\"ph ph-hash text-[16px] text-[#96989F]\" data-kid=\"1-4-7-2-1\" data-name=\"channel hash icon\">\n                </i>\n                <span data-kid=\"1-4-7-2-2\" data-name=\"channel name label\">\n                    #học-tập\n                </span>\n            </div>\n            <p class=\"mt-2 pl-6 text-[11px] leading-[17px] text-[#96989F]\" data-kid=\"1-4-7-3\" data-name=\"channel description text\">\n                Trao đổi tài liệu và kế hoạch học tập của nhóm.\n            </p>\n        </div>\n    </aside>\n</div>\n",
